              "source": "Editor/src/scene/ProjectDocument.cpp  /  Open",
              "code": "if (!startup.empty() &&\n    (startup.has_root_path() ||\n     StartupReference(root, root / startup, false)\n         != startup)) {\n    throw std::runtime_error(\n        \"Invalid project startup scene path.\");\n}",
